{"id":"644852","name":"酱香鸡","author":"琪_feXjZ8E2","authorId":"10602029","desc":"*本菜谱为作者独家发布于美食天下，禁止其他平台或个人转载。","cover":"images/644852/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"鸡肉","amount":"适量"}],"sub":[{"name":"姜","amount":"少许"},{"name":"蒜头","amount":"少许"},{"name":"红葱头","amount":"少许"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"准备:鸡肉。","img":"images/644852/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"姜，蒜头，红葱头。","img":"images/644852/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"热锅放油，下姜，蒜头，红葱头小火爆香。","img":"images/644852/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"再放入鸡块稍微煎一下。","img":"images/644852/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"添加适量的酱油，冰糖。","img":"images/644852/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"大火烧一会儿让鸡块上色。","img":"images/644852/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"添加适量的开水。","img":"images/644852/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"盖上盖子中小火烧煮二十分钟。","img":"images/644852/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"二十分钟过去了鸡块熟透了酱汁还有点多。","img":"images/644852/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"大火收下汁让鸡块色泽更红亮。","img":"images/644852/step_10.jpg"},{"step":11,"desc":"稍微放凉后斩件装盘，淋上酱汁即可。","img":"images/644852/step_11.jpg"},{"step":12,"desc":"成品图。","img":"images/644852/step_12.jpg"},{"step":13,"desc":"成品图。","img":"images/644852/step_13.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：煮锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}